  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into wedges.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6698c55050ddf07e2f0158ce-bbef2636.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While wedges are baking, drain and rinse kidney beans and transfer to a medium bowl. Lightly mash with a fork.\n• Add Cheddar cheese, BBQ spice blend, the egg, milk, panko breadcrumbs and a pinch of salt and pepper, and mix well to combine.\n• Shape mixture into 2 cm-thick patties (1 per person).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6698c55050ddf07e2f0158ce-a7310956.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook bean patties until browned, 3-4 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6698c55050ddf07e2f0158ce-017a79aa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• Spread roll bases with some dill & parsley mayonnaise. Top with salad leaves and American BBQ bean patties.\n• Serve with wedges and remaining herby mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6698c55050ddf07e2f0158ce-713ed503.jpeg"
    }
  ]
